            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to an inhaler with a protective device for protecting the inhaler against removal or replacement of the cartridge, with a readiness indicator for displaying a not-ready-to-trigger state or a ready-to-trigger state, a breath indicator, an inhaler herewith, and an inhaler with an insert for putting the inhaler into a ready-to-trigger state and/or for breaking a tamper-proof seal.</p>
